{"id":405003011,"chapter_id":220101,"scene_id":805,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"【对峙CG】","style":18,"background":4874,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"承霄","content":"一切到此为止了。","voice":["vo_event_405002032_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_50028","style":1,"background":4874,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"？！","style":2,"background":4874,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"承霄","content":"刚才你已经阻止过了，也试图破坏了祭坛。但你没有办法把它们彻底消灭。","voice":["vo_event_405003011_07"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_50031","style":1,"background":4874,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"那些亡魂已经被打散了，接下来只要找到离尘——","style":2,"background":4874,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"承霄","content":"那行“真相”，还有后半句。","voice":["vo_event_405003011_09"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_50031","style":1,"background":4874,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……？","style":2,"background":4874,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"承霄","content":"——“形若无主，万物择其所向。”","voice":["vo_event_405003011_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_50031","style":1,"background":4874,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"承霄","content":"就是说，现在，没有器物镇压的话，那些亡魂只会变得更加躁动，去寻求下一个有形之物。","voice":["vo_event_405003011_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_50031","style":1,"background":4874,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"承霄","content":"比如说……<color=#fb9259>人</color>。","voice":["vo_event_405003011_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_50031","style":1,"background":4874,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"content":"身边的亡魂正狂暴地涌入眼前的通道之中。你盯着那片青色的洪流，心头猛然一沉。它们是在寻找一个可以依附的活生生的躯壳。而你们，包括离尘，都可能是它们的目标。","style":3,"background":4874,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"按这个说法，那不是无路可走了吗？！一切都在他们的计算之中！","style":2,"background":4874,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"content":"其实你不知道自己口中的那个“他们”到底是谁。是那个在祭坛低语的声音？还是命运本身？但你不在乎了。","style":3,"background":4874,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"他们定下的这些规矩……难道真的是对的吗？……刚才，你也听见那些声音了吧？你就这么接受了吗？这就是你所谓的注定吗？！","style":2,"background":4874,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"承霄","content":"对。所以你见过了，也试过了。该知道要放弃了。","voice":["vo_event_405003011_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_50031","style":1,"background":4874,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"speaker":"承霄","content":"规矩的存在，便是不让人轻易逾越。","voice":["vo_event_405003011_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_50031","style":1,"background":4874,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"speaker":"承霄","content":"我以为，你终究和她不一样。你会清楚代价和规则，也尊重它们的重量，懂得何时是自己的极限，要停手了。不像她，始终沉溺于自己的妄想。","voice":["vo_event_405003011_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_50031","style":1,"background":4874,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"speaker":"承霄","content":"既然你也一样执迷不悟，那就让我送你回去。","voice":["vo_event_405003011_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_50031","style":1,"background":4874,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"content":"他再一次抬起手臂。你握紧拳，死死盯住扬在空中的那把剑：赤火涌动，火星勾勒出锋刃的形状。","style":3,"background":4874,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"content":"然后，看准了它向你而来的挥击。","style":3,"background":4874,"log_type":1}]}